Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Post-quantum key-hash spends as a soft fork (regtest
 sketch): OP_NOP10 becomes OP_CHECKPQSIGVERIFY behind DEPLOYMENT_PQSIG;
 ML-DSA-44 (FIPS 204, vendored pq-crystals reference, deterministic signing)
 over a BIP-143-shaped tagged digest; signature and key blob in canonical
 520-byte chunks so the element limit stays; P2SH-wrapped so any wallet can
 pay to it; policy admits the nine-push spend; unit tests and a regtest
 functional test with an independent Python signer. Not scheduled on mainnet
 or testnet.

